      "title": "The production server MUST negotiate Brotli and gzip for compressible client assets and emit \u0060Vary: Accept-Encoding\u0060. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
      "text": "The production server MUST negotiate Brotli and gzip for compressible client assets and emit \u0060Vary: Accept-Encoding\u0060. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
